{"seq":2,"slug":"closure-request-cooling-period","title":"关店申请、冷静期与公示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-offboarding-store-closure/closure-type-request/closure-request-cooling-period","wordCount":2811,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"关店申请-冷静期与公示\">关店申请、冷静期与公示</h1><p>一个商家点击&quot;申请关店&quot;，系统立刻把店铺状态改成关闭——这是最直觉的实现，也是造成最多客诉的实现之一。原因不在于技术，而在于这个动作<strong>同时伤害了两类无辜的人</strong>：还在等货的买家会在商品页看到 404 而不知道自己的订单是否还存在；而商家自己，有相当比例会在几小时或几天内改变主意——尤其是那些刚刚经历一次纠纷、在情绪中按下按钮的商家。关店是一个不可逆的终局决定，但做出这个决定的人处在最容易反悔的状态里。</p>\n<p>因此实际系统里，&quot;关店申请&quot;与&quot;关店生效&quot;之间必须插入一段时间。这段时间的正式名称是<strong>冷静期</strong>（cooling-off period），它的功能不是拖延，而是<strong>让已经产生的履约义务有时间收尾、让冲动决策有时间撤回、让外部相关方有时间被告知</strong>。本文讨论这段时间该怎么设计，以及申请、撤回、公示三者的关系。退出类型的判定（哪些退出需要走冷静期）见 <a href=\"closure-type-inactive-violation\">退出类型：主动关店、违约清退、资质失效与僵死账号</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"冷静期解决的是三个不同的问题\">冷静期解决的是三个不同的问题</h3><p>把冷静期理解为&quot;给商家反悔的机会&quot;是片面的。它同时服务三方，而且三方的时间需求完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>受益方</th>\n<th>需要这段时间做什么</th>\n<th>时间量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商家</td>\n<td>撤回决定、完成在途订单、下载自己的数据</td>\n<td>天到周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家</td>\n<td>看到公示、知道要停止下单、用完已有的券与余额</td>\n<td>周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>冻结提现以外的动作、开始清算核对、准备公示文案</td>\n<td>天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三者取最大值，才是冷静期应有的长度。只按商家的心理需求设成 24 小时，会让买家在毫无预警的情况下发现店铺消失；只按清算需求设成 90 天，又会让决意退出的商家无法及时离场。合理的量级通常在 <strong>2 到 4 周</strong>，具体值由下面&quot;倒推法&quot;决定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"申请是一个状态机-不是一个字段\">申请是一个状态机，不是一个字段</h3><p>关店申请在生命周期里会经历多次状态跃迁，且每一次都需要幂等与可审计。用单个 <code>closure_requested</code> 布尔值无法表达&quot;已申请但已撤回&quot;与&quot;已申请且已生效&quot;的区别，也无法处理&quot;生效前平台发现违约&quot;这类并发事件：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; REQUESTED: 商家提交申请&#10;  REQUESTED --&gt; WITHDRAWN: 商家撤回&#10;  REQUESTED --&gt; REJECTED: 平台驳回&lt;br/&gt;(存在未决争议)&#10;  REQUESTED --&gt; PENDING: 冷静期开始&lt;br/&gt;公示发布&#10;  PENDING --&gt; PENDING: 冷静期内新增订单&lt;br/&gt;(逐步停止接单)&#10;  PENDING --&gt; EFFECTIVE: 冷静期届满&#10;  PENDING --&gt; WITHDRAWN: 冷静期内撤回&#10;  PENDING --&gt; ESCALATED: 冷静期内&lt;br/&gt;判定为违约清退&#10;  ESCALATED --&gt; EFFECTIVE: 按清退流程生效&#10;  WITHDRAWN --&gt; [*]&#10;  REJECTED --&gt; [*]&#10;  EFFECTIVE --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; REQUESTED: 商家提交申请\n  REQUESTED --&gt; WITHDRAWN: 商家撤回\n  REQUESTED --&gt; REJECTED: 平台驳回&lt;br/&gt;(存在未决争议)\n  REQUESTED --&gt; PENDING: 冷静期开始&lt;br/&gt;公示发布\n  PENDING --&gt; PENDING: 冷静期内新增订单&lt;br/&gt;(逐步停止接单)\n  PENDING --&gt; EFFECTIVE: 冷静期届满\n  PENDING --&gt; WITHDRAWN: 冷静期内撤回\n  PENDING --&gt; ESCALATED: 冷静期内&lt;br/&gt;判定为违约清退\n  ESCALATED --&gt; EFFECTIVE: 按清退流程生效\n  WITHDRAWN --&gt; [*]\n  REJECTED --&gt; [*]\n  EFFECTIVE --&gt; [*]</pre><p>其中 <code>ESCALATED</code> 是必须存在的跃迁：一个申请主动关店的商家，如果在冷静期内被风控判定为刷单，它就不再是&quot;主动退出&quot;，而应当转为违约清退路径处理——因为两条路径的责任后果完全不同（主动退出不留违规记录，清退留）。<strong>没有这个跃迁，商家可以通过先申请关店来掩盖违规</strong>：申请提交后，风控的处置动作会被流程冻结，等店铺干净地关掉，违规记录也就无从落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冷静期的长度用倒推法确定\">冷静期的长度用倒推法确定</h2><h3 id=\"三个时钟取最大值\">三个时钟取最大值</h3><p>冷静期的下限由两个可计算的量决定，而不是由产品经理的直觉决定。</p>\n<p>第一个是<strong>履约窗口</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：从冷静期开始到平台不再接受新订单所需的时间。如果冷静期内仍允许接单（通常如此，只是逐步限制），那么冷静期至少要短于&quot;冷静期开始后新订单能在关店生效前完成交付&quot;的时间。设平均履约时长（下单到签收）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则要求</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mtext>last_order_date</mtext><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mtext>cooling_start</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_f \\ge \\text{last\\_order\\_date} + \\bar{L} - \\text{cooling\\_start}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">last_order_date</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9034em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cooling_start</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第二个是<strong>清算周期</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：从停止接单到可以确定全部可扣与可付金额所需的时间，它由账期、拒付窗口与在途退款共同决定。如果冷静期短于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，商家会在清算未完成时就失去对店铺的访问，导致对账争议无处申诉。</p>\n<p>因此冷静期长度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\max(W_f,\\; W_s,\\; W_{notice}) + \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{notice}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是外部告知所需的最短时间（见下一节的公示节奏），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是操作缓冲。实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常最大，因为拒付窗口以周计。三个量的来源与典型量级如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>由什么决定</th>\n<th>典型量级</th>\n<th>若被忽略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 履约窗口</td>\n<td>平均履约时长与其长尾</td>\n<td>1–2 周</td>\n<td>最后一批订单跨过生效时刻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 清算周期</td>\n<td>账期 + 拒付窗口 + 在途退款</td>\n<td>3–6 周</td>\n<td>清算未完成即失去对账入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{notice}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 告知时间</td>\n<td>公示渠道与买家触达节奏</td>\n<td>1–2 周</td>\n<td>买家毫无预警地面对关店</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"撤回与撤销是两个不同的操作\">撤回与撤销是两个不同的操作</h3><p>这两个词在中文里常被混用，但在流程语义上必须分开。三种&quot;申请没有走完&quot;的结局，其发起方、留痕与统计口径都不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>发生时机</th>\n<th>是否留退出记录</th>\n<th>是否计入闭店率</th>\n<th>谁可发起</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>撤回 withdraw</td>\n<td>生效前</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>商家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>驳回 reject</td>\n<td>生效前</td>\n<td>是（不进入清算）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤销 reverse</td>\n<td>生效后</td>\n<td>是（新增 REVERSED 事件）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>平台（依申诉结果）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>驳回的语义是&quot;现在不能退&quot;，它在商家提交申请时存在未决争议（在途的大额拒付、未结的侵权投诉）时使用。它与撤回的区别是<strong>发起方不同、且驳回会留下记录</strong>——这条记录在商家再次申请时是有用的上下文。</p>\n<p>撤销的工程意义在于：撤回的店铺在统计上从未退出过，而撤销的店铺是一次<strong>已发生的退出</strong>，必须计入闭店率并单独统计撤销率——因为这个比率直接衡量平台的退出判定质量，是 <a href=\"../data-release-lifecycle/reactivation-readmission-rule\">关店复活、再入驻限制与退出度量</a> 中度量体系的一项输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"公示-把退出告诉不该被漏掉的人\">公示：把退出告诉不该被漏掉的人</h2><h3 id=\"公示对象的分层\">公示对象的分层</h3><p>&quot;关店公示&quot;常被做成一条站内公告，这是不够的。退出需要被告知的对象有三层，每层的内容与渠道都不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>必须知道什么</th>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>时点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>已下单未收货买家</td>\n<td>订单仍然有效、交付时间、售后找谁</td>\n<td>订单页 + 站内信</td>\n<td>冷静期开始</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>潜在买家（浏览者）</td>\n<td>该店将关闭，下单前请确认交付</td>\n<td>店铺页横幅</td>\n<td>冷静期开始</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台内部（客服、风控、清算）</td>\n<td>退出类型、生效时刻、待办事项</td>\n<td>内部事件总线</td>\n<td>申请提交时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管/收单机构（特定情形）</td>\n<td>依据与措施内容</td>\n<td>正式函件</td>\n<td>生效后按需</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三层与第四层最容易被忽略。内部未同步会导致客服在冷静期内继续向买家承诺&quot;该店会发货&quot;；监管未告知会在检查中被认定为程序缺失——尤其是当退出属于限制或终止服务性质时，必须能提供一份可挑战的说明。</p>\n<h3 id=\"说明内容的最小集合\">说明内容的最小集合</h3><p>对在线中介服务提供者，当措施涉及暂停或终止服务、关闭账户时，需要向受影响用户提供&quot;清晰且具体的说明&quot;，其内容应涵盖措施本身、地域范围与持续时间、支撑事实、措施是否源于第三方举报、是否使用自动化手段、法律或合同依据、以及可用的救济途径（<a href=\"https://www.eu-digital-services-act.com/Digital_Services_Act_Article_17.html\">DSA Article 17 — Statement of reasons</a>）。对<strong>主动关店</strong>而言，大部分字段是平凡的（无支撑事实、无自动化），但仍应生成一份统一格式的说明文书——因为格式统一才能被程序化生成与审计，而不是每类退出各写一份文案。</p>\n<p>欧盟《促进在线中介服务商业用户公平与透明条例》（Regulation (EU) 2019/1150）第 4 条的标题即为&quot;限制、暂停与终止&quot;（Restriction, suspension and termination），把终止服务的规则与限制措施并列规定（<a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eur/2019/1150/contents\">legislation.gov.uk — Regulation (EU) 2019/1150 contents</a>）。这意味着<strong>主动申请的关店也必须按同一套程序要求留下记录</strong>，不能因为&quot;是商家自己要走的&quot;就省掉说明与通知。</p>\n<h3 id=\"公示与营销工具的联动\">公示与营销工具的联动</h3><p>公示期开始后，平台侧应当同步收缩该店的营销能力：停止投放、停止流量扶持、停止参与大促报名。这不是惩罚，而是<strong>避免用平台的流量为一个即将消失的店铺导流</strong>——买家从广告位进来、下单、然后发现店铺正在关闭，这个体验损失由平台承担。收缩应当在进入 <code>PENDING</code> 时立即生效，且同样要有幂等的开关控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"申请与冷静期的数据模型\">申请与冷静期的数据模型</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE merchant_closure_request (&#10;  request_id      BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  merchant_id     BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  closure_type    VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;ACTIVE&#39;,&#10;  requested_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  cooling_end_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,     -- 冷静期届满时刻&#10;  order_cutoff_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,     -- 停止接单时刻，早于 cooling_end_at&#10;  state           VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,     -- REQUESTED|PENDING|WITHDRAWN|ESCALATED|EFFECTIVE|REJECTED&#10;  notice_doc_ref  VARCHAR(255),             -- 已生成的说明文书&#10;  updated_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT ck_order_cutoff CHECK (order_cutoff_at &lt;= cooling_end_at),&#10;  CONSTRAINT ck_state CHECK (state IN&#10;    (&#39;REQUESTED&#39;,&#39;PENDING&#39;,&#39;WITHDRAWN&#39;,&#39;ESCALATED&#39;,&#39;EFFECTIVE&#39;,&#39;REJECTED&#39;))&#10;);&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_closure_open_request&#10;  ON merchant_closure_request (merchant_id)&#10;  WHERE state IN (&#39;REQUESTED&#39;,&#39;PENDING&#39;,&#39;ESCALATED&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> merchant_closure_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  merchant_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closure_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ACTIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  requested_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cooling_end_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 冷静期届满时刻</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_cutoff_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 停止接单时刻，早于 cooling_end_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- REQUESTED|PENDING|WITHDRAWN|ESCALATED|EFFECTIVE|REJECTED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  notice_doc_ref  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">255</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 已生成的说明文书</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ck_order_cutoff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_cutoff_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cooling_end_at),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ck_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REQUESTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WITHDRAWN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ESCALATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EFFECTIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REJECTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uq_closure_open_request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_closure_request (merchant_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REQUESTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ESCALATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>uq_closure_open_request</code> 是这张表的关键：它是一个<strong>部分唯一索引</strong>，保证同一商家同时最多只有一个未完结的退出申请。没有它，商家的重复点击或重试会产生多条并行申请，各自带一个冷静期，最终导致&quot;店铺已关闭但仍有未届满的申请&quot;这类状态矛盾。部分索引把并发控制交给数据库而非应用层，这在多服务环境里更可靠。</p>\n<p>状态跃迁则应一律用条件更新，避免读-改-写竞态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE merchant_closure_request&#10;   SET state = &#39;WITHDRAWN&#39;, updated_at = now()&#10; WHERE request_id = $1&#10;   AND state IN (&#39;REQUESTED&#39;,&#39;PENDING&#39;)&#10;   AND merchant_id = $2;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_closure_request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'WITHDRAWN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REQUESTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>state IN (...)</code> 这一段就是乐观锁：如果该申请在读到与写入之间已经被风控推进到 <code>ESCALATED</code>，这条更新影响 0 行，撤回失败——这是正确结果，因为一旦升级为清退，商家就不再有权单方面撤回。<strong>把状态前置条件写进 WHERE 子句，而不是先查后判</strong>，是这类流程表的基本纪律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>冷静期同时服务商家、买家与平台三方，长度应由 <code>履约窗口</code>、<code>清算周期</code>、<code>外部告知时间</code> 三者取最大值再加缓冲，实践中通常落在 2–4 周。</li>\n<li>关店申请是状态机而非布尔字段；其中 <strong><code>ESCALATED</code> 跃迁不可省</strong>，否则商家能借主动申请掩盖违规、阻断风控落地。</li>\n<li>撤回（生效前，不留记录）与撤销（生效后，保留记录并计入撤销率）必须分开建模，前者不进闭店率分母。</li>\n<li>公示对象分四层，内部同步与监管告知最易被漏；说明文书应统一格式以便程序化生成与审计，其内容最小集合由 <a href=\"https://www.eu-digital-services-act.com/Digital_Services_Act_Article_17.html\">DSA Article 17</a> 给出。</li>\n<li>终止服务的程序要求同样适用于商家主动申请的场景（Regulation (EU) 2019/1150 第 4 条把&quot;限制、暂停与终止&quot;并列，<a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eur/2019/1150/contents\">来源</a>），不能因&quot;是商家自己要走的&quot;而免去说明与通知。</li>\n<li>公示期内应同步收缩营销能力，避免用平台流量为一个正在消失的店铺导流。</li>\n<li>用<strong>部分唯一索引</strong>约束单一未完结申请、用<strong>条件更新</strong>约束状态跃迁，把并发正确性下沉到存储层。</li>\n<li>冷静期结束后进入收尾，履约与资金的具体处理见 <a href=\"../winddown-obligation/listing-delist-intransit-fulfill\">商品下架与在途订单履约责任</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关店申请、冷静期与公示","id":"关店申请-冷静期与公示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"冷静期解决的是三个不同的问题","id":"冷静期解决的是三个不同的问题"},{"level":3,"text":"申请是一个状态机，不是一个字段","id":"申请是一个状态机-不是一个字段"},{"level":2,"text":"冷静期的长度用倒推法确定","id":"冷静期的长度用倒推法确定"},{"level":3,"text":"三个时钟取最大值","id":"三个时钟取最大值"},{"level":3,"text":"撤回与撤销是两个不同的操作","id":"撤回与撤销是两个不同的操作"},{"level":2,"text":"公示：把退出告诉不该被漏掉的人","id":"公示-把退出告诉不该被漏掉的人"},{"level":3,"text":"公示对象的分层","id":"公示对象的分层"},{"level":3,"text":"说明内容的最小集合","id":"说明内容的最小集合"},{"level":3,"text":"公示与营销工具的联动","id":"公示与营销工具的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"申请与冷静期的数据模型","id":"申请与冷静期的数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"退出类型：主动关店、违约清退、资质失效与僵死账号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-offboarding-store-closure/closure-type-request/closure-type-inactive-violation"},"next":{"title":"买家告知与收尾窗口期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-offboarding-store-closure/closure-type-request/buyer-notification-winddown-window"}}